View and manage games that should not have their DLLs swapped (usually due to anti-cheat).

Usage:
  spela denylist [command]

Available Commands:
  allow       Force-allow a denied game
  check       Check if a game is denied
  deny        Add a game to the deny list
  show        Show the deny list

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for denylist

Use "spela denylist [command] --help" for more information about a command.
